IMPORTANT
The motion roles and three illustrated directional studies are preserved, but this is not a fully calibrated drop-in replacement for the original 3D rig. Side and rear art depict distinct views and are not mirrors. They are not proven exact 135 and 225 degree rotations, and view-to-view registration/shape volume is approximate.

The exact old Blender rig/action files are retained under technical_reference, for camera and animation evidence only. Their old low-poly visual exports are not preferred art in this package.

Scuttle is in-place. The animation JSON supplies suggested screen-space travel per second so stance feet can remain planted when the actor moves in a game. Without matching travel, the gait will appear to slide against a stationary ground. No engine runtime integration is claimed.
